&lt;p&gt;An account can be several years old while still having serious security issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Similarly, a newer account can become valuable through legitimate communication and responsible use.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, age should be considered only one characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;

