&lt;p&gt;Telegram 2-Step Verification&lt;br&gt;
Telegram provides 2-Step Verification as an additional security layer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to Telegram's official FAQ, when 2-Step Verification is enabled, logging in requires both the login code and an additional password. Users can also set a recovery email to help regain access if they forget the password.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is especially important for accounts with valuable conversations, groups, channels, or business communications.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A strong security setup can include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2-Step Verification&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Strong account password&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Secure recovery email&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Device passcode&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regular session reviews&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Secure phone-number control&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram Passkeys&lt;br&gt;
Telegram also supports passkeys.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to Telegram's current FAQ, a passkey can allow users to log in using a device PIN or biometric authentication instead of relying solely on SMS.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Passkeys can provide another convenient authentication option.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, users should still maintain access to an up-to-date phone number controlled by them.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram specifically warns that users risk losing access if the account remains connected to a phone number they no longer control.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Why Phone Number Control Matters&lt;br&gt;
The phone number is one of the most important components of Telegram account access.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If someone changes their phone number permanently, Telegram recommends changing the number connected to the account while they still have access to the existing account and phone number.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is important because simply having login credentials at one moment does not necessarily guarantee long-term account access.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A responsible account strategy should always consider:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Who controls the phone number?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can the number receive login codes?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is the number current?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is the number secure?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can the legitimate account holder recover access?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Privacy Considerations for Old Telegram Accounts&lt;br&gt;
Privacy is especially important when dealing with established messaging accounts.&lt;/p&gt;

