&lt;p&gt;Telegram explicitly prohibits using the service to send spam or scam users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, marketing activity should be based on permission, relevance, and responsible communication.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram Groups and Channels&lt;br&gt;
Telegram provides both groups and channels for community communication.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Groups can support discussion and community interaction.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Channels are useful for broadcasting information to an audience.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram's FAQ explains that groups can support very large communities and channels can broadcast to unlimited audiences.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This makes Telegram useful for:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Communities&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;News updates&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Business announcements&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Educational content&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Creator communities&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Customer communication&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, building a successful group or channel requires genuine audience interest rather than simply relying on an old account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Old Telegram Accounts and Spam Restrictions&lt;br&gt;
Spam is one of the major issues Telegram users should understand.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram's Privacy Policy explains that if a spam report against a message is confirmed by moderators, an account may be limited from contacting strangers, either temporarily or permanently. More serious violations can result in a ban.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, an old account should never be treated as immune from restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Responsible users should avoid:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Unwanted mass messaging&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Repeated unsolicited promotions&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scam messages&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Phishing&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Misleading offers&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Abusive automated behavior&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Account age does not eliminate these risks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Why “Old” Does Not Mean “Ban-Proof”&lt;br&gt;
A common misconception is that older Telegram accounts are protected from restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That is not a reliable assumption.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram's policies apply to users regardless of account age. Its Terms of Service prohibit spam, scams, and certain other forms of abuse.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Therefore, no responsible provider should promise:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;“100% ban-proof”&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;“Unlimited messaging”&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;“Permanent access”&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;“Guaranteed spam-free”&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;“Guaranteed high reach”&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Such claims should be approached carefully.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Security Risks of Purchased or Transferred Accounts&lt;br&gt;
