&lt;p&gt;Unknown Previous Access&lt;br&gt;
A previous user may have access to the account or associated recovery methods.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Active Sessions&lt;br&gt;
Old sessions may remain active on other devices.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Phone Number Issues&lt;br&gt;
The connected phone number may not remain under the current user's control.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Privacy Concerns&lt;br&gt;
