&lt;p&gt;Historical Restrictions&lt;br&gt;
The account may have experienced previous spam reports or restrictions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Account Recovery&lt;br&gt;
If legitimate recovery information is unavailable, long-term access may become uncertain.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These issues make account security and legitimate ownership important considerations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How to Secure an Established Telegram Account&lt;br&gt;
A responsible security review can include several steps.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Review Active Sessions&lt;br&gt;
Check the devices currently logged into the account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Remove sessions that are not recognized or no longer needed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enable 2-Step Verification&lt;br&gt;
Telegram recommends 2-Step Verification for additional protection.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Protect the Recovery Email&lt;br&gt;
If a recovery email is used, secure that email with a strong password and additional authentication where available.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use an App Passcode&lt;br&gt;
A device or application passcode can help protect Telegram if someone gains physical access to the device.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Review Privacy Settings&lt;br&gt;
Check who can see:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Phone number&lt;/p&gt;

